## 4. `components/projects/floor-plan-viewer.tsx` — 324 lines

`"use client"`. Props: `{ options: PlanOption[] }` where `PlanOption = { bhk: string; carpetArea: number; facing: Facing }`. Constants `MIN_ZOOM = 1`, `MAX_ZOOM = 3`.

**State**: `active` (index into options), `zoom`, `offset {x,y}`, plus `dragState = useRef<{x,y}|null>`. Resolves `plan = getFloorPlan(option.bhk)`.

**Zoom** — `changeZoom(delta)` clamps to `[1,3]`; if it lands back at `MIN_ZOOM` it also resets `offset` ("Snapping back to 1 should also recentre, or the plan drifts off-frame").

**Keyboard** — the container is `tabIndex={0} role="img"` with an `onKeyDown` switch; step is `12 / zoom` (pan slows as you zoom in):

```tsx
const onKeyDown = (event: React.KeyboardEvent) => {
  const step = 12 / zoom;
  switch (event.key) {
    case "+": case "=": changeZoom(0.5); break;
    case "-":           changeZoom(-0.5); break;
    case "0":           reset(); break;
    case "ArrowLeft":  setOffset((o) => ({ ...o, x: o.x + step })); break;
    case "ArrowRight": setOffset((o) => ({ ...o, x: o.x - step })); break;
    case "ArrowUp":    setOffset((o) => ({ ...o, y: o.y + step })); break;
    case "ArrowDown":  setOffset((o) => ({ ...o, y: o.y - step })); break;
    default: return;
  }
  event.preventDefault();
};
```

**Pan** — Pointer Events with capture, and **drag is disabled entirely at zoom 1** (`if (zoom === MIN_ZOOM) return` in `onPointerDown`); `setPointerCapture(event.pointerId)`; `onPointerUp`/`onPointerCancel` clear `dragState`.

**Rendering** — a single `<svg viewBox={\`-2 -2 ${plan.width + 4} ${plan.height + 4}\`} className="block h-auto w-full">` with **CSS transform, not viewBox math**:

```tsx
style={{
  transform: `translate(${offset.x}px, ${offset.y}px) scale(${zoom})`,
  transformOrigin: "center",
}}
```

Inside: `plan.rooms.map(room => <RoomShape room carpetArea={option.carpetArea} />)` plus an entry marker (gold `<circle r={0.6}>` + "Entry" text at `plan.entry`). `<Compass facing />` is absolutely positioned top-right, outside the SVG.

**Layout** — outer `grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr]`: left = config tab buttons (`aria-pressed`, only when `options.length > 1`), the plan, control row (`Plus` / `Minus` / `RotateCcw` icon buttons + hint text "Drag to pan when zoomed · arrows, +, − and 0 also work"), and a "Schematic — not to scale / Artist's impression" disclaimer. Right = a `<dl>` of Configuration / Carpet area / Facing plus `vastuNote(option.facing)`.

**Sub-components**: `RoomShape` (fill by `room.kind`: living→`--cream`, bedroom→`--ivory`, else transparent; stroke `--stone` at `strokeWidth={0.12}`; two `<text>` labels at unitless font sizes 0.85 / 0.7), `Compass` (rotates a `<path>` needle by `compassRotation(facing)` degrees, with an `sr-only` "North is towards the …"), and `ControlButton` (h-9 w-9 bordered square with `aria-label`).

**Relevance to a 3D interior**: the container has `overflow-hidden` and `touch-none` only when zoomed; the `options` array + active-index tab pattern is directly reusable as a 3D view switcher; the accessibility contract to preserve is *keyboard-complete without pointer* and a visible text disclaimer.

