## 11. Conventions & constraints to respect

- **`AGENTS.md`** warns loudly: *"This is NOT the Next.js you know"* — read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing App Router code. Confirmed Next-16-isms in use: global `LayoutProps<"/">` / `PageProps<"/projects/[slug]">` types, `await params`.
- **`CLAUDE.md` §7 "WebGL / Three.js Guardrails"** is a hard spec and directly governs all three features. Verbatim highlights: PBR `MeshStandardMaterial` only, *"Never flat unlit meshes"*; *"no jarring cuts or free-roam (motion sickness). Dampened lerp / GSAP drone-like reveals"*; hero scene **<100k triangles, <30 draw calls, DPR ≤1.5**; Draco/meshopt GLTF + KTX2/WebP textures; *"never allocate inside `useFrame`/rAF"*; pause rAF offscreen and on tab blur; **OffscreenCanvas + Web Worker** recommended to keep INP <200ms; `dynamic(… { ssr:false })` always; reserve dimensions with `aspect-ratio` to prevent CLS; mobile/low-power/reduced-motion get a static WebP; *"Progressive enhancement is mandatory: real H1, body copy and links live in server-rendered HTML behind/around the canvas. Bots read HTML, not WebGL pixels."*
- Also in CLAUDE.md: §6 design system (60-30-10, motion tokens `--ease-entrance: cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)`, `--ease-transition: cubic-bezier(0.65,0,0.35,1)`), §8 page-by-page spec, §13 legal (RERA §11(2)/§12/§59, DPDP), §15 acceptance criteria, §16 build order. The §8 PROJECT DETAIL entry already anticipates the master plan, floor-plan viewer and 360° tour as specified features.
- Tailwind v4 `@theme inline` tokens in `app/globals.css` (297 lines): `--color-charcoal`, `--ivory`, `--cream`, `--gold`, `--gold-soft`, `--bronze`, `--forest`, `--navy`, `--stone`, `--stone-2`. Utilities `.container-page`, `.section`, `.measure`, `.eyebrow`, `.unit-cell[data-status]`. Keyframes `fade-in-canvas`, `rise`, `nudge`. Three.js code uses these as raw hex (`#141414`, `#2a2622`, `#b99c6b`, `#f5f1e8`) or `fill-[var(--gold)]` in SVG.
- Comment style throughout is a distinctive first-person engineering-rationale voice explaining *why*, often citing `CLAUDE.md §n`. Match it.
- `next.config.ts` is empty (no transpile/webpack config) — adding GLTF loaders or worker bundling would be the first change there.
